<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven stocks fell, one rose and four were flat in 8.1 million zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday with the WIG 20 index down 1.3 percent to 1,541.9 points.</p>
<p>The remaining 11 stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.4 percent in a 6.3-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
